# A powerslide is a trick: held 0.75 s at 9 m/s and let go, it banks as "FS Powerslide" (the nose
# swings counterclockwise for a regular rider: frontside, like a spin), 100 + 120 per second.
# A tap shorter than slide.minScoreTicks (0.25 s) scores nothing (the second slide).
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -20 -12 0.13 90
cmd 9 speed 9
hold slide 10..100
hold slide 150..170
run 260
expect event comboLanded{name=FS Powerslide,points=190} within 100..125
expect event comboLanded count == 1
expect no event bail
